@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy for Barbella Inventory";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<h2>1. Who are we?</h2>
<p>We are Barbella Inventory — a tool that helps you manage products, stock, and inventory easily and safely.</p>

<h2>2. What information do we collect?</h2>
<p>We collect simple information to make the app work, such as:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Your name (if you register)</li>
    <li>Your email (for login or support)</li>
    <li>The products and inventory data you add</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Why do we collect this information?</h2>
<p>We collect your information so that:</p>
<ul>
    <li>You can use the inventory system</li>
    <li>We can save your products and data</li>
    <li>We can help you if you need support</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Do we share your data?</h2>
<p>No! We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or share your personal data with other companies or people.</p>

<h2>5. How do we keep your data safe?</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Your data is protected with secure storage.</li>
    <li>Only you (with your login) can see your data.</li>
    <li>We regularly check for security.</li>
</ul>

<h2>6. Can you delete your data?</h2>
<p>Yes! You can contact us anytime and ask to delete your data, and we will remove it completely.</p>

<h2>7. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
<p>If we change anything, we will let you know here and by email.</p>

<h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have questions or need help, you can contact us:</p>
<p>📧 Email: <a href="mailto:support@barbellainventory.com">support@barbellainventory.com</a></p>
